# Google OAuth client and user token for the PO sheet sync.
# The token file holds a refresh_token, client_id and client_secret — never
# commit it. Both the plain and google-prefixed names are covered, since the
# files get downloaded under either name.
credentials.json
token.json
google-credentials.json
google-token.json
